---
# Not linted: MiniaudioImplementation.cpp compiles miniaudio's and stb_vorbis's implementations, tens of thousands of
# lines of third-party C that would trip almost every check. Disabling every check makes clang-tidy skip this folder
# before compiling anything; the rest of the module is linted as usual.
InheritParentConfig: false
Checks: '-*'
...
